\hCan increase or decrease
the persuasiveness of their
\hown words and actions. 
\h·Can gain knowledge about
\hthe insides of monsters
\hranked C or lower and all
\hcommon beasts, as well as
\hmethods for cooking them. 
\h·Can gain knowledge
\habout edible plants.</b>

00:10:56.360 --> 00:10:57.900
Creature magic...

00:10:57.900 --> 00:11:03.160
"Can speed up or slow down the cellular 
metabolism of creatures by touching with the palm."

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:08.120
"Can increase or decrease the persuasiveness 
of their own words and actions."

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:10.140
I don't get it.

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:13.720
Also... my stats went down!

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:21.000
Now for the moment you've been waiting for:

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:24.590
the hero's first round of combat!

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:28.040
<i>But if I can win this,</i>

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:32.390
<i>get those horses, and then 
save all three of them...</i>

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:35.290
<i>Maybe, just maybe...</i>

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:37.140
Ready... fight!

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:39.050
<i>I'd finally be popular?!</i>

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:41.220
He's seriously not coming?!

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:42.850
He's the absolute worst!

00:11:42.850 --> 00:11:47.160
Are we gonna be stuck here 
for 35 whole days?!

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:48.610
<i>Yotsuya-kun...</i>

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:50.350
<i>Please be all right.</i>

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:53.090
The hero is dead!

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:59.030
m 0 0 l 155 0 l 155 200 l 0 200

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:59.030
<b>[Loikayeksa]</b>

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:59.030
►Materials
Flochienge steel, elm wood,
meri kobold hide

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:02.310
The winner: Kahvel the knight!

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:04.340
<i>Damn...</i>

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:06.990
<i>Damn, damn, damn! That's insane!</i>

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:08.580
<i>It was over in five seconds!</i>

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:10.840
The hero has revived!

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:11.630
Wow...

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:12.960
That's a hero for you!

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:12.960
So that's what a hero can do...

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:15.010
<i>Damn it. I'm pathetic.</i>

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:17.840
You really did come back to life!

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:21.460
Just like the rumors said!

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.490
Uh... hi.

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:25.600
<i>And she's a girl, no less!</i>

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:28.990
I wasn't sure what I'd do if 
you didn't come back to life.

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:30.230
Oh, really?

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:33.840
I'm seeing some deep uncertainty in 
my future for a different reason.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:38.940
So, um... I couldn't talk you into 
lending me those horses, could I?

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:43.950
I desperately need to get to 
Radodorbo in the next 35 days.

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:45.860
Radodorbo?

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:48.380
I'm told it's on the western 
edge of the continent.

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:50.410
The western edge?

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:54.030
And any traveling merchants would only 
go as far as the next town over...

00:12:54.780 --> 00:12:59.530
Maybe... I could do some work for 
you, in exchange for horses?

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:01.220
Within five days?

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:04.450
Well, if you'll help with taking 
down large monsters...

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:08.210
One horse for defeating one 
troll, for example...

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:11.390
But could we find a troll within five days?

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:12.600
Defeating monsters?

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:19.150
How about a group of bandits?

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:21.560
This is where the bandits' base is?

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:24.060
We had completely overlooked this.

00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:26.500
You have my thanks, hero.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:29.160
Not at all. So, um...

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:31.920
I can't spare three horses,

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:34.080
but I think I can manage one.

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:37.510
<i>There's still a glimmer of hope!</i>

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:41.930
So we need to strike before daybreak?

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:44.490
We have nearly half a day.

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:47.290
What do you say to some sword 
practice in the meantime?

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:47.830
Huh?

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:52.260
Forgive my saying so, but you seem 
to be a novice with the sword.

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:54.300
I could help you train, if you'd like.

00:13:54.670 --> 00:13:56.740
<i>Well, with only one horse,</i>

00:13:56.740 --> 00:14:00.400
<i>I might be the only one who 
can make it to Radodorbo.</i>

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:03.070
Okay. I'd appreciate it.

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:06.500
You can't hold a sword?

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:08.520
That's right. Just give me a sec.

00:14:12.550 --> 00:14:16.120
All right, I'll begin 
attacking in five seconds.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:18.030
You can do as you see fit until then.

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:30.510
You're a lot better than 
when we started, but...

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:33.930
I'd rank your sword skill at 
the low end of mid-range.

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:37.590
<i>Becoming a Wizard returned my 
physical abilities to average.</i>

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:40.850
<i>This is bringing back that 
old inferiority complex...</i>

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:43.540
Where are you even aiming, Yotsuya?!

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:46.690
Yotsuya! Why are you passing 
to the other team?!

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:50.020
Your bat and the ball aren't 
even at the same height!

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:53.630
<i>I suck at sports that involve 
balls and swinging things.</i>

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:56.680
<i>Humans move in too many different ways!</i>

00:14:56.940 --> 00:15:02.200
It may be that you're unable 
to see your own movements.

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:02.840
Huh?

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:04.950
The problem is your form.

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:08.600
If you do a thousand practice swings 
a day, you should improve.

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:10.430
Got it.

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:12.950
<i>A thousand?!</i>

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:31.140
We enter before the sun rises!

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:34.510
Yeah!

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:37.490
Wait, he's heading this way?

00:15:37.940 --> 00:15:40.340
I guess that means he won.

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:43.130
If he didn't, I'll never 
let him live it down!

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.560
You said it.

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:46.870
Hurry up and get here!

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:51.050
Those damn heroes are getting cocky.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:51.890
Don't.

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:56.050
You should know better than anyone after 
her wind magic busted your eardrums.

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:56.800
Damn it!

00:15:56.800 --> 00:16:00.650
I won't be satisfied until I'm 
rolling in that ransom money!

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:07.910
Patrolling seriously sucks.

00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:09.230
Yeah.

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:11.570
The sun's finally coming up.

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:23.860
Charge!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:27.950
We're under attack! It's the army!

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:32.710
<i>Compared to Kahvel-san's sword swings,</i>

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:34.040
<i>these are easy to see!</i>

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:38.130
<i>And as long as I'm being attacked myself,</i>

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:41.760
<i>just countering doesn't seem 
to affect my experience.</i>

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:44.840
Shit! Let him out of the cage!

00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:46.110
Got it!

00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:50.540
I'm opening the cage!

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:54.590
They're letting him out!

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:55.760
Run!

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:01.380
Captain Kahvel, the bandits are fleeing!

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:04.030
Maqua, take ten people to pursue them.

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:06.120
If you can't catch up, 
you can come back here.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:06.860
Right!

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:08.900
<i>What's in that cage?</i>

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:13.060
<i>A ferocious beast? A troll?</i>

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:24.130
What the hell is that?!

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:26.080
A berserker.

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:27.560
Berserker?!

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:30.990
Eating flesh imbued with more 
magic than a human can digest,

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:34.920
such as monster flesh,
causes one to lose all reason

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:36.750
and become a berserker.

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:37.400
Wait!

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:39.340
He can swing a longsword with one hand?!

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:42.240
How is he so strong?!

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:44.300
Stand down! I'll handle this!

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:48.530
Are you kidding me?!

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:49.290
Not bad!

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:53.500
You've made me draw Roykayeksa!

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:57.100
Whoa! Captain Kahvel's 
drawn her great sword!

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:59.350
Also known as the Great Sword of Annihilation.

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:01.430
We're counting on you, Captain Kahvel!

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:06.270
There's nothing I love more 
than cleaving the flesh...

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:08.770
of living things!

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:09.600
Wha?

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:16.870
That's why, even though I'm a woman, 
I chose to be a knight and not a housewife!

00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:19.690
Because I can slice flesh!

00:18:20.190 --> 00:18:24.490
And now that I've found a creature 
I can keep cleaving over and over,

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:27.040
I couldn't be more elated!

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:28.050
Huh?!

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:31.930
I'm just dying to cut some berserker flesh!

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:34.880
<i>They're even? 
No, he has the edge in sheer strength.</i>

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:38.080
<i>But damn, even with that size difference...</i>

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:41.410
<i>It's impressive enough that 
she's holding her own,</i>

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:44.870
<i>but Kahvel-san will probably 
run out of stamina first!</i>

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:55.940
<i>That broke a few of my fingers!</i>

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:57.860
<i>Is this it? Isn't there anything I can do?!</i>

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.270
<i>Weapons...</i>

00:18:59.270 --> 00:19:00.320
<i>Abilities...</i>

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:01.280
<b>Wizard (Creature)</b>

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:01.330
<i>Creature magic...</i>

00:19:01.690 --> 00:19:03.770
<i>The persuasiveness... 
of my words and actions...</i>

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:03.780
<b>Can increase or decrease the persuasiveness
of their own words and actions.</b>

00:19:04.460 --> 00:19:05.860
<i>can be increased?</i>

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:07.210
Hey!

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:12.050
That guy behind you is about to kill you.

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:15.750
<i>So that's how it works!</i>

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:24.060
<i>In one blow?!</i>

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:31.950
All right! Find any remaining bandits!

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:33.060
Shit!

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:35.190
Did they all get taken out?!

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:38.010
Don't go out there! 
They won't find us in here.

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:42.400
I found more!

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:47.700
Uh... So, listen...

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:49.640
Thanks for saving us.

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:53.410
I'm sorry. I lost the tournament 
in the first round.

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:54.630
You lost?!

00:19:55.010 --> 00:19:57.710
I did manage to get us one horse...

00:19:57.710 --> 00:19:59.660
So only one of us can ride it?

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:03.310
Well, two, if we hook 
it up to a carriage...

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:06.210
If I may, heroes?

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:08.030
Who are you?

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:10.860
My name is Kahvel, and I am a knight.

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:13.170
I would like to offer a suggestion.

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:20.160
Uh... this way to move 
forward, and backward is...

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:25.270
There is no greater honor for a 
knight than to accompany heroes.

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:27.990
Allow me to extend my 
gratitude as her father.

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:30.340
It's fine. We really appreciate the help.

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:34.230
I will request an extended 
leave and some men,

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:36.710
and escort you as far as I can.

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:38.790
What? You will?

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:40.420
I request two things in payment.

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:44.890
First, upon arrival in Radodorbo, 
you will give me your horse.

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:48.130
Sure, no problem. We won't need it anymore.

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:49.800
And second...

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:55.720
I want you to let me train the 
four of you with the sword!

00:20:56.670 --> 00:21:00.110
I'm a little curious as to 
why she looked so happy...

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:04.980
Sword training, eh?

00:21:04.980 --> 00:21:08.850
I'm sure I need some of that. 
I <i>am</i> a warrior.

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:12.030
As for me, though, I'm a magical girl.

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:14.880
Th-Thank you for your help.

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:21.220
A lot happened, but I guess 
it all turned out okay, huh?

00:21:22.700 --> 00:21:24.820
What did you and my dad talk about?

00:21:24.820 --> 00:21:26.590
Oh, just thanking each other.

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:27.800
I see.

00:21:28.710 --> 00:21:29.510
Then...

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:31.820
Off we go!

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:40.070
<b><b>Kahvel of Cortonel</b></b>

